<title>USA: MGE wheat/barley/shrimp deliveries - Dec 16.</title>
<headline>MGE wheat/barley/shrimp deliveries - Dec 16.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Minneapolis Grain Exchange Grain reported the following deliveries against December futures (wheat in 000 bu, shrimp in lots) -</p>
<p>SPRING WHEAT - 25. Oldest long November 8, 1996.</p>
<p>Put out by - Atwood Commodities/c 25 (redelivery).</p>
<p>Stopped by - Atwood Commodities/c 25.</p>
<p>Delivery location - Minneapolis</p>
<p>WHITE WHEAT - Nil.</p>
<p>BLACK TIGER SHRIMP - 5. Oldest long December 13, 1996.</p>
<p>Put out by - Goldenberg Hehmeyer/c 3, Frontier Futures/c 2.</p>
<p>Stopped by - Cargill</p>
<p>Investor Services/c 5.</p>
<p>BARLEY - Nil.</p>
<p>WHITE SHRIMP - Nil.</p>
<p>H=House. C=Customer account.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
